{"5318890":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"LILY'S TASKBAR HUSTLE","steam_appid":5318890,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing—aim to become a millionaire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while you’re working on your PC, Lily keeps working away in the corner of your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a desktop-resident idle game set in the turbulent city of “GRIT City.”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily starts out with almost nothing—no coins and no job.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether working at a construction site, delivering pizzas, cleaning the streets, or working as a security guard… she’ll take on various jobs to collect coins and aim for 1,000,000 coins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basics of the game are very simple.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use “WORK” to earn coins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get tired, take a break with “REST.”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve finished the day’s work, move on to the next day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the game can be left running in the corner of your screen, you can enjoy it while doing your usual PC activities—like working, studying, or watching videos.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From small jobs to big dreams!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you can only do simple jobs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as you collect Coins and grow, new jobs and new areas of the city will gradually unlock.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction sites, pizza delivery, security, office work…<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of job will you take on today to collect Coins?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, you never know what might happen.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about working.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, you might get attacked by a stray dog.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOOF! -5 Coins<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you might get a tip from a customer.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NICE TIP! +5 Coins<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might chase thieves, break tools, pick up a wallet, or even get caught up in strange, inexplicable events.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are good times and there are terrible times.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy these unpredictable random events.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work, rest, and rise to the top.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect Coins, your character’s life will gradually change.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with nothing, she gradually becomes more prosperous as she continues working.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s only one goal.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1,000,000 Coins<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re working, studying, or just relaxing and watching videos,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in the corner of your desktop, she’s living her life today.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work. Rest. Get Rich.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And try not to get bitten by a dog.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing—aim to become a millionaire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while you’re working on your PC, Lily keeps working away in the corner of your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a desktop-resident idle game set in the turbulent city of “GRIT City.”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily starts out with almost nothing—no coins and no job.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether working at a construction site, delivering pizzas, cleaning the streets, or working as a security guard… she’ll take on various jobs to collect coins and aim for 1,000,000 coins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basics of the game are very simple.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use “WORK” to earn coins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get tired, take a break with “REST.”<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve finished the day’s work, move on to the next day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the game can be left running in the corner of your screen, you can enjoy it while doing your usual PC activities—like working, studying, or watching videos.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From small jobs to big dreams!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you can only do simple jobs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as you collect Coins and grow, new jobs and new areas of the city will gradually unlock.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction sites, pizza delivery, security, office work…<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of job will you take on today to collect Coins?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, you never know what might happen.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about working.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly, you might get attacked by a stray dog.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOOF! -5 Coins<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or you might get a tip from a customer.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NICE TIP! +5 Coins<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might chase thieves, break tools, pick up a wallet, or even get caught up in strange, inexplicable events.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are good times and there are terrible times.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy these unpredictable random events.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Work, rest, and rise to the top.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect Coins, your character’s life will gradually change.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with nothing, she gradually becomes more prosperous as she continues working.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s only one goal.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1,000,000 Coins<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re working, studying, or just relaxing and watching videos,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in the corner of your desktop, she’s living her life today.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work. Rest. Get Rich.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And try not to get bitten by a dog.<\/p>","short_description":"Start from nothing and become a millionaire in GRIT City! Join Lily in this chaotic desktop idle game as she earns coins through construction, deliveries, cleaning, and more. Encounter random events, take breaks, and work your way toward 1,000,000 Coins—all while you work, study, or relax!","supported_languages":"English, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5318890\/121a0d6d34a97a93c55a2fc319b5502fd6643a38\/header.jpg?t=1793696492","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5318890\/839fb86bc60e9ecc861b8effa5fd483cc2a6cb47\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793696492","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5318890\/839fb86bc60e9ecc861b8effa5fd483cc2a6cb47\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793696492","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i3 Dual Core<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Desktop-resident widget<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["OneCraft"],"publishers":["OneCraft"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":299,"final":239,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"$2.99","final_formatted":"$2.39"},"packages":[1838149],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy LILY'S TASKBAR HUSTLE","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1838